---
import SceneFigure from "@/components/art/SceneFigure.astro";
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { ArrowRight } from "@lucide/vue";
---
<SiteLayout pageId="workWithNari">
  <section class="work-note page-width" id="collaboration-note"><div class="work-opening"><div><p class="eyebrow">A good first conversation</p><h1>Let's make<br /><em>something lovely.</em></h1><p class="intro-line">Clear expectations. Room for personality.</p><p>Bring a clear idea, honest terms, and enough room for Nari to still sound like Nari.</p></div><SceneFigure scene="workWithNari" class="work-scene" eager priority /></div><dl class="collaboration-fits"><div><dt>Creator collaborations</dt><dd>Thoughtful streams, videos, and community projects with clear expectations.</dd></div><div><dt>Creative opportunities</dt><dd>Projects with room for personality, color, and Nari's self-taught nail-art perspective.</dd></div><div><dt>Brand partnerships</dt><dd>Respectful ideas, transparent deliverables, and a genuine fit with her people.</dd></div></dl>
  <h2>Tell her what you have in mind.</h2><ol class="brief-list"><li><strong>The idea.</strong> Project, audience, platform, timing, and who's involved.</li><li><strong>The details.</strong> Deliverables, approvals, usage rights, deadlines, and compensation.</li><li><strong>The fit.</strong> Why Nari, and what makes it right for her community.</li></ol><div class="contact-note" id="nari-links"><p>A dedicated business inbox hasn't been published yet. You can find Nari through her public profiles.</p><a class="text-link" href="/links/">Find Nari's public profiles <ArrowRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
